# Documentation conventions

- Public-facing docs in English: root README, docs/whitepaper.md, package READMEs.
- Design docs in Russian: docs/master-plan.md, docs/01-core.md,
  docs/02-mcp-server.md, docs/03-dsh-plugin.md.
- Code and docs change together: schema change → update docs/01-core.md;
  tool change → update docs/02-mcp-server.md; roadmap progress → tick
  checkboxes in docs/master-plan.md in the same commit.
- Product vocabulary is fixed: consensus = "zhoda", transcript = "хроніка",
  factions = "фракцыі". Don't invent synonyms in docs.
- No promises without evidence: benchmark numbers go into docs only after
  they are measured and reproducible.
